OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fand showers pushing north through the
OL,7,Fevening with most showers gradually
OL,8,Ffading. Drier overnight with some
OL,9,Fclear spells although the odd shower
OL,10,Fcannot be ruled out. Another mild
OL,11,Fnight to come.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA dry start to the day, but
OL,14,Fshowers start to develop from mid-
OL,15,Fmorning. Again, the risk of thunder
OL,16,Fand possible hail. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
